{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/DesolusLogoWhite.png?t=1748058779\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a city of Gothic architecture torn between past and future in Desolus, a first person puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enigmatic cataclysm has fractured reality, opening portals which lead to other times. Explore the past and future versions of an expansive city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01Portal.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve Escher-like puzzles through the use of black holes, traveling back and forth through time to make architecture whole again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01BlackHole.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your spatial thinking by navigating impossible architecture, as reality distorts and time becomes increasingly unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01Impossible.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate holograms to move massive portals between floors of crumbled cathedrals, allowing you to traverse structures which only partially exist in one time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01Hologram.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partner with the city's guardian to prevent a cataclysm which threatens to merge past and future. Save the City of Desolus from annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01Guardian.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desolus has been selected for several festivals, including an exhibit at the Smithsonian American Art Museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/DesolusSteamLaurels.png?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a very small indie team, every Steam Wishlist significantly helps. <strong>Please wishlist!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1003460?t=1748058779","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/a6e5842609adb8203a066bc407ceffd7b099daa6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748058779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748058779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748058779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/DesolusLogoWhite.png?t=1748058779\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a city of Gothic architecture torn between past and future in Desolus, a first person puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enigmatic cataclysm has fractured reality, opening portals which lead to other times. Explore the past and future versions of an expansive city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01Portal.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve Escher-like puzzles through the use of black holes, traveling back and forth through time to make architecture whole again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01BlackHole.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your spatial thinking by navigating impossible architecture, as reality distorts and time becomes increasingly unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01Impossible.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate holograms to move massive portals between floors of crumbled cathedrals, allowing you to traverse structures which only partially exist in one time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01Hologram.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Partner with the city's guardian to prevent a cataclysm which threatens to merge past and future. Save the City of Desolus from annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/2023_STEAMGIF_01Guardian.gif?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desolus has been selected for several festivals, including an exhibit at the Smithsonian American Art Museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/extras/DesolusSteamLaurels.png?t=1748058779\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a very small indie team, every Steam Wishlist significantly helps. <strong>Please wishlist!</strong></p>","developers":["Mark J. Mayers"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1003460/header.jpg?t=1748058779","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257141041,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141041/movie480.mp4?t=1747655013","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141041/movie_max.mp4?t=1747655013"},"name":"DESOLUS Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141041/4fa5a1e7da544cc2ca7a07a2cc2fb9ce9e99212d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747655013","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141041/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747655013","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257141041/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747655013"}}],"name":"DESOLUS","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600X / Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i7-6800K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 5700 / NVIDIA GeForce 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</stron